  "limitations": [
    "Uncontrolled experimental environment, small sample size, and interfering noises in pilot VR experiment.",
    "Uncalibrated samples in pilot VR experiment.",
    "Lack of controlled laboratory conditions (e.g., consistent audio/video reproduction system) in online experiment.",
    "Potential for visual cues from VR HMD to influence EEG alpha power in occipital regions, requiring cautious interpretation.",
    "Sampling bias towards a 'WEIRD' (Western, Educated, Industrialized, Rich, and Democratic) population."
  ],
